{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_002_02_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5425ef0c3679d76887c66c492e9fa07081382060e81cc88d33d67cd61459114c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:717349b5739b72fe788d8a36a370b6d7964d6dc296846f3a00f2875cc812fc0f",
      "text": "大概，我再也无法\n驾驶飞机了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:201138b170f20c6ab015ed4d681f6d0775b092411ad6917f9dd4cc04df45de4d",
      "text": "没看气象雷达吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9552dc1ee0117daeac09e1fc5e634a15badb0370adaa0c0664e0edaca0d1ca9f",
      "text": "你在干什么！！换我来！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1c467295ff5958c8d169a9ee48ead9abc26b3ba0fe1c93a8c96d27d784095dd",
      "text": "啊……啊啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fb4f4fa92c7aabd9d61a67a9c29519b8bca4059aa4873a0f0e31c2da52d47eb",
      "text": "……在大家的期待中迎来的\n第一次飞行，我就栽了个大跟头。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4ef393e54e10bd88b5fa4367c0eac62095d880b1d2a25e31b4d109f7ed4ec83",
      "text": "受到颠簸气流的影响，\n即使机舱内陷入了恐慌……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:740c5677200fcd613c5810a905b7e07f71f9d4da3adf3ad350cc2730d1852bd3",
      "text": "我却只能跟着大家\n一起手足无措。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:727c55626ee4746814e68f9d8b9e383efdf67fc4d2e367fc31222a3835aed120",
      "text": "到了现在，我连进驾驶舱都觉得害怕。\n明明从小时候起，就那么憧憬天空。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4436100cf3c1765ad367268410f344798dc83ad2b04629447bd91dab40c036fb",
      "text": "很逊吧，\n追逐梦想，有一两次失败不是家常便饭吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:215eabd259fe2c7317519822522392295d0bc73b20b220d0439b670d4aa7c5c0",
      "text": "可是，我却连跨过去的勇气都没有。\n一直只是像这样，在这个地方胆怯而已……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60a7e2381694f26bf7ce0ec052ad04f6680737d0d6def0eff36178d5c441e85b",
      "text": "没有那回事。\n那种经历任谁都不可能马上振作起来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24f5b75615c96015e153a612bdbe87b69e14e7183a48941d6a9989bc7a9a7017",
      "text": "……谢谢您。没能回应大家的期待，\n固然十分惭愧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddd6ade1199d6a592c3187e2a2ef8de51434ba5d6e188b279713c0cde9a68ede",
      "text": "但最重要的是，再也无法在心爱的天空翱翔，\n才是最让我寂寞的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
